# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env -- it is in .gitignore.
# NEVER paste a key into a chat window, a document, or a screenshot.
#
# FIVE seats, five keys, one per vendor. All five are reached the same way and
# are blinded identically -- see PANEL_OF_FIVE_EXTERNAL.
#
# load_panel() FAILS CLOSED on a missing or blank credential: a panel that
# quietly runs short misstates rho, effective seats, and the residual.
#
# MODEL: put the EXACT id string from that vendor's model page. The marketing
# name on the box is not the id the API wants. If a name below disagrees with
# the vendor's own page, THEIR PAGE IS RIGHT -- these were gathered by web
# search because the vendor doc sites are unreachable from the build machine.

# --- Seat 1 --- OpenAI. Recommended: GPT-5.6 Sol (their flagship)
ADJ_SEAT_1_API_KEY=
ADJ_SEAT_1_MODEL=

# --- Seat 2 --- Google. Recommended: the PRO tier, NOT Flash.
# Flash is the fast/cheap tier; a weak seat contributes misses that are
# indistinguishable from the whole panel's misses.
ADJ_SEAT_2_API_KEY=
ADJ_SEAT_2_MODEL=

# --- Seat 3 --- Mistral. Recommended: Magistral Medium (their reasoning model,
# a better fit here than the general Large model)
ADJ_SEAT_3_API_KEY=
ADJ_SEAT_3_MODEL=

# --- Seat 4 --- xAI. Recommended: Grok 4.3 (flagship, reasoning on by default)
ADJ_SEAT_4_API_KEY=
ADJ_SEAT_4_MODEL=

# --- Seat 5 --- Anthropic. Recommended: Claude Opus 5
# Reported id: claude-opus-5 -- confirm on their model page.
# This seat has its own key so it is blinded exactly like the other four. Run
# with --seat5 in-process ONLY if a genuinely separate session supplies it.
ADJ_SEAT_5_API_KEY=
ADJ_SEAT_5_MODEL=
